        "title": "Not Worth it",
        "text": "Apologies to all fans of Pashupatinath Temple, but it wasn't worth the money I paid. $1500 rupees is not that much for a tkt, but compared with other great sites like Budhanath Temple which we paid $300 Rupees it's a big let down, considering you can't get inside the Golden Temple or any other attraction in the Heritage site. Ignore the guides as they would be useless. It's different and culturally chocking to see cremation ceremony taking place, but there are some other amazing sites in Kathmandu. ",
