        "title": "Racists",
        "text": "I am married to a fair woman and was told I as an Indian could enter but my WIFE could not. Did not matter if we were Hindu or if she was Hindu. If you are white, you are not allowed in. You can pay 1000 rupees to see bodies being burnt and relatives crying, if you are white, but you cannot pay to enter the temple. It does not matter if you are a white Hindu or a fair indian Hindu, you will be turned away from visiting one of the holiest places in your religion. This goes against everything the hindu religion teaches, it's embarrassing.",
